post_install() {
  cat <<'EOF'

                       ▄▀▀▀▀ █   █ ▄▀▀▀▀ ▄▀▀▀▀    ▄▀    ▄▀
                        ▀▀▀▄ ▀▀▀▀█  ▀▀▀▄ █      ▄▀    ▄▀
                       ▀▀▀▀  ▀▀▀▀▀ ▀▀▀▀   ▀▀▀▀ ▀     ▀
                      //  SEE YOU SPACE COWBOY //

v0.3.0 adds the L2A1 SAR, statue and fighter effects, and Higgs Field.
Models gain particle shading, flight motion and Napoleon dissolution.

Select an effect in sysc-shell Settings, or run sysc-terminal --list.
Docs: https://nomadcxx.github.io/sysc/docs/

EOF
}

post_upgrade() {
  post_install
}
